    <title>Eggs: Importance in Diets</title>
    <content>
<![CDATA[
<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM 'http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd'>
<en-note>
<h2>Why eggs matter</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Eggs provide protein and choline.</li>
  <li>Egg yolks contain about 200 mg of cholesterol.</li>
</ul>
<p>Reference: <a href="https://nutritionsource.hsph.harvard.edu/food-features/eggs/">Harvard T.H. Chan: Eggs</a></p>
</en-note>
